  "description": "*\"I thought I had lost my future forever... But the moment I realized that it had returned to me, my hands trembled with both joy and wonder.\"* \n\nYudrein Ail is a commoner who was bestowed with powers on the night the Red Stone fell. He is also the first omega to rise to the rank of Imperial Trooper, but was accused of a crime he didn’t commit and executed soon after - only to reawaken eleven years ago, before the war began. He can't repeat the mistakes of his past…to survive is to save the world. But in order to do so, he must prevent the man he killed from facing his inevitable death. \n\n*\"The future won't be the same. I'll make sure of it.\"* \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
